  "question": {
    "text": "If the solution curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, which passes through the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and intersects the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
