  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now putting in equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math> we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now Integrating Both side</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Also&nbsp; this curve passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now putting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
